        "title": "Memfilter Nilai",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148342,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Misalkan kita ingin menemukan objek game tertentu yang memenuhi kondisi yang ditentukan dan mengekstraknya ke dalam array baru.</p><p>Salah satu cara untuk melakukannya adalah melalui loop.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  dangerousEnemies.push(element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148343,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebagai gantinya, kita bisa menggunakan fungsi <code>.filter()</code>. <code>.filter()</code> membuat array baru dengan nilai-nilai yang memenuhi suatu kondisi.</p><p><code>.filter()</code> menggunakan sintaks: <code>ArrayName.filter()</code>. Mari panggil method ini pada array <code>enemies</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".map()\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemies</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>filter</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148344,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> apakah harus menyertakan atau mengecualikan sebuah nilai dalam array baru, kita perlu meneruskan sebuah fungsi sebagai parameter.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148345,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita perlu memberikan fungsi inline akses ke elemen-elemen array.</p><p>Untuk melakukannya, kita cukup menambahkan parameter ke fungsi. Dalam hal ini, kita akan menggunakan <code>element</code>, tetapi nama apa pun bisa digunakan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"126\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elixir&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helmet&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Arrow&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sItems = inventory.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;S&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(sItems);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148346,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> nilai mana yang harus disimpan di array baru, pernyataan <code>return</code> dalam fungsi tersebut harus mengembalikan boolean.</p><p>Biasanya kita menulis kondisi yang melibatkan elemen atau indeks array dan menghasilkan nilai boolean.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"arr\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"123\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>return</code>, diikuti oleh <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148347,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika kita menyertakan parameter kedua dalam fungsi <code>filter()</code>, kita bisa mengakses indeks setiap iterasi bersama nilai array.</p><p>Dalam contoh ini, kita akan menyebut parameternya <code>index</code>, tetapi nama apa pun dapat digunakan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"145\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTiles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawn&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Grass&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Exit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Void&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playableTiles = levelTiles.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (index &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &amp;&amp; index &lt; \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playableTiles);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148348,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menyederhanakan sintaks kita, kita bisa menggunakan fungsi arrow JavaScript sebagai pengganti fungsi inline.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"106\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"72\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"71\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dangerousEnemies = enemies.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(dangerousEnemies);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>element</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>element &gt;= 90</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148349,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fungsi JavaScript mana yang dapat kita gunakan untuk membuat array baru berisi elemen-elemen yang memenuhi suatu kondisi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.filter()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.filter()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148350,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang harus kita berikan sebagai parameter untuk memberi tahu fungsi <code>.filter()</code> nilai mana yang harus disertakan dalam array baru?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebuah fungsi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya pernyataan kondisional</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebuah fungsi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148351,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara meneruskan nilai array ke fungsi inline <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan menambahkan parameter ke fungsi inline</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dengan menambahkan parameter kedua yang wajib ke fungsi inline</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan menambahkan parameter ke fungsi inline.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148352,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang bisa kita akses dengan menyertakan parameter kedua dalam fungsi inline <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Indeks saat ini dalam iterasi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Array pemanggil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Indeks saat ini dalam iterasi.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148353,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis nilai apa yang dikembalikan fungsi inline dari <code>.filter()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Boolean</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sebuah string</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Boolean.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148354,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kita mungkin menggunakan arrow function sebagai pengganti fungsi inline?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena arrow function menyederhanakan sintaks</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena arrow function tidak memerlukan parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena arrow function menyederhanakan sintaks.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148355,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi <code>.filter()</code> pada array <code>loot</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"map\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Torch&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Trap&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tunic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" arr = loot.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(arr);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>loot</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>filter</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148356,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan fungsi inline di dalam fungsi <code>.filter()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hitPoints = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" tankyEnemies = hitPoints.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>function</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter yang sesuai agar fungsi inline dapat mengakses nilai-nilai array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"111\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damageValues = [\" /><text value=\"19.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"18.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lightHits = damageValues.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"damage\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" damage &lt; \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lightHits);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148358,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuliskan keyword yang benar agar fungsi <code>.filter()</code> mengisi array <code>safeZones</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" collisionDamage = [\" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"73\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"77\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"82\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"93\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" safeZones = collisionDamage.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"dmg\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" dmg &gt; \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(safeZones);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 148359,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kodekan parameter dalam urutan yang benar agar <code>first3</code> menyimpan tiga <code>highScores</code> pertama.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"114\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScores = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sara&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first3 = highScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"player, rank\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rank &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first3);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>rank</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 148360,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat kode fungsi arrow yang mengembalikan <code>true</code> jika indeks elemen kurang dari 3.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"121\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" highScores = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sara&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jake&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Alex&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tori&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first3 = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" highScores.filter(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"player, rank\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" rank &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first3);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(player, rank)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=&gt;</code>, lalu <code>rank</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
